r black thigh-high stockings, and chunky knee-high lace-up combat platform boots. Her toned, athletic physique is fully exposed at the midriff.\n\nShe sits regally upon an ornate throne carved in the shape of a snarling, fanged beast's head — part dragon, part demonic feline — its silver-grey surface intricately detailed with bones, scales, and gothic ornamentation. Her booted foot rests on a battered metal road case wrapped in heavy chains and covered in stickers and band decals.\n\nIn her right hand she grips a massive medieval war scythe, its long wooden shaft wrapped in leather, the enormous curved blade arcing dramatically over her head. Perched on her left fist, talons gripping her knuckles, is a majestic American bald eagle with pristine white head feathers and a sharp yellow beak, staring off to the side with predatory alertness.\n\nStudio lighting is hard and theatrical, casting crisp shadows. The composition is symmetrical, iconic, and poster-like — punk rock goddess of war meets American mythology. Hyperrealistic, high-fashion photography, 8k, sharp detail, magazine cover quality."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 72, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 152, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [226.61392211914062, 88], "pos": [327.5069580078125, -633.07421875], "id": 51, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [158, 159], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["krea-2-turbo.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dty